{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e01-scene-02",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "走吧！  (Let's Go In!)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫",
    "fang": "方老师"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Outside Media College, Qin Xiao is waiting for her classmate Bu Xiaogu so they can see their advisor Professor Fang together about their theses. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我不像你那么受重用。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "他们没给我多少活干。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "待了半天我就回来了呗。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那你怎么不先进去啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "方老师让我等你一起。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "免得耽误他的时间。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "走吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "小谷，秦箫，来来来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "你们俩的论文初稿都已经通过了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "接下来抓紧时间，把最终稿交上来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "是，老师。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我不像你那么受重用。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am not as highly valued as you are.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "他们没给我多少活干。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They have not given me much work to do.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "待了半天我就回来了呗。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I stayed half a day and came back, that was all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那你怎么不先进去啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then why did you not go in first?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "方老师让我等你一起。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Professor Fang asked me to wait for you so we could go together.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "免得耽误他的时间。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So we would not waste his time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "走吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's go.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "小谷，秦箫，来来来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, Qin Xiao, come on in.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "你们俩的论文初稿都已经通过了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Both of your first thesis drafts have already passed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "接下来抓紧时间，把最终稿交上来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Next, make good use of the time and hand in the final draft.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "是，老师。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, Professor.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我不像你那么受重用。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "他们没给我多少活干。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "待了半天我就回来了呗。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那你怎么不先进去啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "方老师让我等你一起。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "免得耽误他的时间。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "走吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "小谷，秦箫，来来来。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "你们俩的论文初稿都已经通过了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "接下来抓紧时间，把最终稿交上来。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "是，老师。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Both thesis drafts are approved, and now Professor Fang wants to hear how their internships are going. You learned how to say \"zou ba\", ask \"how come?\" with \"zenme\", and address a teacher politely. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
